From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jiaxing Hu <gahing@gahingwoo.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 15:03:12 +1300
Subject: [PATCH] accel/rocket: 2 ms job timeout to force resets (TEST ONLY)

Igor Paunovic's induced-reset protocol: with a 2 ms timeout ordinary jobs
time out and every one goes through rocket_reset(). Fork CI testing only.

Signed-off-by: Jiaxing Hu <gahing@gahingwoo.com>
---
 drivers/accel/rocket/rocket_job.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/accel/rocket/rocket_job.c b/drivers/accel/rocket/rocket_job.c
index 2c700aaea43d..5fbb94875658 100644
--- a/drivers/accel/rocket/rocket_job.c
+++ b/drivers/accel/rocket/rocket_job.c
@@ -19,7 +19,7 @@
 #include "rocket_job.h"
 #include "rocket_registers.h"
 
-#define JOB_TIMEOUT_MS 500
+#define JOB_TIMEOUT_MS 2
 
 #define RK3576_PC_TASK_CON_TASK_NUMBER(n)	((n) & 0xffff)
 #define RK3576_PC_TASK_CON_PP_EN		BIT(16)
-- 
2.43.0

